---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Work With Me - Nivedita Pandey" description="Work with Nivedita Pandey - startup and SME advisory, AI and innovation advisory for institutions, fractional leadership, AI capacity building, speaking, and Dendrons.ai products.">
  <div class="wwm-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Work With Me</h1>
      <p class="page-description">
        Everything on this site - the zero-to-one builds, the playbooks, the training - is available in seven ways.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="model-grid">

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">01</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">Advisory &amp; Board Roles for Startups &amp; SMEs</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For founders and owner-led businesses.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">For startups: zero to one, GTM, and new market entry across Asia, the US, and Europe. For SMEs: AI-led transformation, from first use case to running capability. Available for advisory and board positions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">02</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">AI &amp; Innovation Advisory for Institutions</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For governments, multilaterals, and regulated financial institutions.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">The RBIH and World Bank playbook: from AI use-case selection and innovation strategy to governance and cross-border DPI partnerships.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">03</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">Fractional AI &amp; Growth Leadership</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For organisations that need the function built before they can justify the full-time executive.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">First-hire operator experience: new verticals, new markets, new products - from blank page to a running team.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">04</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">AI &amp; Digital Innovation - Capacity Building</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For governments, PSUs, and enterprises that want their people able to evaluate, pilot, and deploy AI.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">473 government officers trained so far, IAS and State Civil Services among them - 210 through a 20-session AI-led governance innovation workshop, the rest via 2-session overviews. Rated 4.81/5.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">05</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">AI &amp; Digital Innovation - Capacity Building for PSUs</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For public sector enterprises building AI capability in technical and operations teams.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">AI training delivered for CMPDIL (Central Mine Planning &amp; Design Institute, a Coal India subsidiary and Mini Ratna Category 1 PSU) - 35 senior executives trained in a full-day workshop on applied AI in mining and operations. NPS 9.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">06</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">Speaking &amp; Media</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For conferences, broadcasters, and institutions.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">Keynotes, panels, workshops, and interviews - from national TV to international webinars. Topics, past stages, and a featured talk on the <a href="/speaking/">Speaking page</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="model-card">
        <span class="model-number">07</span>
        <h2 class="model-name">Product Partnerships via Dendrons.ai</h2>
        <p class="model-for">For organisations whose problem is already solved by a product.</p>
        <p class="model-desc">getHeard, Compass, getBookings, NITI Scope, and the wider <a href="https://dendrons.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dendrons.ai</a> suite - the productised route to the same playbooks.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="wwm-cta">
      <p class="wwm-availability">Based in Singapore. Working internationally - remote or on site - across US, European, and Asian time zones.</p>
      <p class="wwm-cta-text">Tell me what you're trying to build.</p>
      <a class="wwm-cta-button" href="mailto:np@dendrons.ai?subject=Working%20together">np@dendrons.ai →</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wwm-page {
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .page-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .model-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .model-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .model-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .model-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .model-for {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .model-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .model-desc a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .wwm-cta {
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.25);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.05);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .wwm-availability {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .wwm-cta-text {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .wwm-cta-button {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    align-self: flex-start;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .wwm-cta-button:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .model-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
